{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","星体燃炽"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","燃える恒星"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤“恒星”并激发场上所有“恒星”造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","「恒星」を召喚し、フィールド上の「恒星」を活性化させ、敵に範囲ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用终极技能时消耗600点能量，选择1个地图格，在对应位置召唤1颗“恒星”，对周围1格范围内的敌人造成360% + 30% ATK伤害。随后激发自身的所有“恒星”，使每颗“恒星”对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并眩晕2秒。被激发的“恒星”会进入燃烧状态6秒，期间每秒对周围1格范围内的敌人造成36% + 6% ATK伤害。最多召唤3颗“恒星”。召唤新的“恒星”时，若数量已达上限，则优先替换范围内敌人数量最少的且持续时间最长的“恒星”。每个地图格只能存在1颗自身的“恒星”，自动释放该技能时，将会优先选择敌人最密集且不与自身其它“恒星”重叠的地图格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","必殺技発動時、SPを600消費し、選択した1マスに「恒星」を1個召喚し、半径1マス以内の敵に360% + 30% ATKのダメージを与える。その後、自身のすべての「恒星」を活性化させ、それぞれの半径1マス以内の敵に240% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、2秒間のスタンを付与。活性化した「恒星」は6秒間、「高熱」状態になり、毎秒、半径1マス以内の敵に36% + 6% ATKのダメージを与える。同時に存在できる「恒星」の数は3個まで。上限を超えて「恒星」を召喚する時、新しい「恒星」は優先的に範囲内の敵が最も少ない、かつ存在時間が最も長い「恒星」と入れ替わる。1つのマス上に存在できる自身の「恒星」は最大1個まで。オート戦闘の場合、敵が最も密集していて、かつ自身の他の「恒星」が存在しないマスを優先的に選択"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":107,"end":113,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":164,"end":169,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":111,"end":117,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":181,"end":186,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":103,"end":117,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":161,"end":173,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":107,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":178,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至270% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒42% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","活性化時のダメージが270% + 30% ATKにUPし、「高熱」状態の毎秒ダメージが42% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":43,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒48% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","活性化時のダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUPし、「高熱」状態の毎秒ダメージが48% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":43,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒54% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","活性化時のダメージが330% + 30% ATKにUPし、「高熱」状態の毎秒ダメージが54% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":43,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“恒星”激发伤害提升至360% + 30% ATK，燃烧伤害提高至每秒60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","活性化時のダメージが360% + 30% ATKにUPし、「高熱」状態の毎秒ダメージが60% + 6% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":43,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","引力坍缩"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","重力崩壊"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤“行星”围绕“恒星”盘旋；主动释放时牵引敌人并造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","「恒星」の周りを周回する「惑星」を召喚。アクティブ効果：敵を引き寄せ、ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，每次召唤“恒星”时，在其相邻格生成1颗“行星”，优先生成在相邻格内生命值最低的敌人所在格。并对该格子上的敌人造成120% ATK伤害。“行星”会以6秒一周的速度围绕对应的“恒星”盘旋，对碰撞到的敌人造成90% ATK伤害，每名敌人每3秒最多受到1次该伤害。每当“行星”完成一周盘旋时，对中心格内的敌人造成180% ATK伤害。主动释放时，操控场上所有“恒星”与“黑洞”，牵引其周围2格范围内的敌人至最近的“恒星”或“黑洞”，并造成270% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：「恒星」を召喚するたびに、その「恒星」の隣接マスに「惑星」を1個生成。「惑星」は優先的に隣接マスのうち、HPが最も低い敵がいるマスに生成され、マス上の敵に120% ATKのダメージを与える。「惑星」は6秒ごとに対応する「恒星」の周りを1周し、ヒットした敵に90% ATKのダメージを与える。同じ敵が3秒ごとに受ける「惑星」によるダメージは最大1回まで。「惑星」は1周するたびに、中央マスにいる敵に180% ATKのダメージを与える。アクティブ効果：フィールド上のすべての「恒星」と「ブラックホール」を操作し、その周囲2マス以内の敵を最も近い「恒星」または「ブラックホール」へ引き寄せ、270% + 30% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":223,"end":229,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":303,"end":309,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":105,"end":112,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":156,"end":164,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":219,"end":233,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":84,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":135,"end":142,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":205,"end":213,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":299,"end":313,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","牵引伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","引き寄せる時のダメージが300% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","牵引伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","引き寄せる時のダメージが330% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","牵引伤害提升至360% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","引き寄せる時のダメージが360% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","暗芒脉冲"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","暗星の脈動"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","向敌人数量最多的3条直线发射脉冲射线造成伤害，并基于实际伤害获得护盾。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵が最も多い3つの方向に直線状の脈動を発射し、敵にダメージを与え、実際に与えたダメージに応じてシールド値を獲得"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","分别从3个方向朝覆盖敌人最多的轴线发射脉冲射线，对命中的敌人造成210% + 30% ATK伤害，并获得等同于本技能实际伤害总量90% + 9%的护盾，持续9秒。脉冲射线每次命中敌人时，还会额外击破其护盾，单次最多击破270% + 30% ATK的护盾值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","軸線上の敵が最も多い3つの方向へ脈動を発射し、ヒットした敵に210% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、「このスキルで実際に与えたダメージの合計値×90% + 9%」分のシールド値を9秒間獲得。脈動が敵にヒットするたびに、その敵のシールドを270% + 30% ATK分削る"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":67,"end":72,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":113,"end":119,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":78,"end":83,"power_type":"skill","para